---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
const updated = '13 November 2026';
const delMail = `mailto:${site.email}?subject=Data%20Deletion%20Request&body=I%20would%20like%20AV%20Sports%20and%20Infrastructure%20to%20delete%20the%20personal%20data%20associated%20with%20my%20enquiry.%0A%0AName%3A%0APhone%2Femail%20used%3A%0A`;
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="How AV Sports and Infrastructure collects, uses and protects your personal information." path="/privacy">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h1 class="section-title">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="muted">Last updated: {updated}</p>

      <p>{site.name} ("we", "us", "our") is committed to protecting your privacy. This policy explains what personal information we collect when you use our website or contact us, how we use it, and the choices and rights you have. It applies to {site.domain.replace('https://', '')} and to enquiries you make with us by phone, WhatsApp or email.</p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>
      <p>We only collect what we need to respond to you and deliver our services:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Enquiry details</strong> you provide through our quotation form, WhatsApp or email, such as your name, phone number, email address, city and details of the sports facility you are planning.</li>
        <li><strong>Project information</strong> you share during a site survey or quotation, such as the site location, dimensions and requirements.</li>
        <li><strong>Technical data</strong> collected automatically, such as your approximate location, browser type, device and pages visited, through cookies and analytics (see our <a href="/cookies">Cookie Policy</a>).</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we use your information</h2>
      <p>We use your information to prepare quotations, arrange and conduct site visits, deliver and support your project, respond to your questions, and keep records required for our business and legal obligations. We may contact you about your enquiry by phone, WhatsApp, email or SMS. We do not sell your personal data, and we do not use it for unrelated advertising.</p>

      <h2>Legal basis</h2>
      <p>We process your personal data to take steps at your request before entering into a contract, to perform our services, to meet legal obligations, and for our legitimate interest in running and improving our business. Where the law requires it, we rely on your consent, which you may withdraw at any time.</p>

      <h2>Sharing your information</h2>
      <p>We share your data only where necessary: with our own site and installation teams, and with trusted service providers who help us operate, such as hosting, analytics and communication tools. These providers may process data on our behalf under appropriate safeguards. We may also disclose information where required by law or to protect our legal rights. We do not sell or rent your data to third parties.</p>

      <h2>Data retention</h2>
      <p>We keep enquiry and project information for as long as needed to serve you and to meet our legal, accounting and record-keeping obligations, after which it is securely deleted or anonymised.</p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>Subject to applicable law, including India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023, you may request access to the personal data we hold about you, ask us to correct or update it, ask us to delete it, or object to certain processing. To exercise any of these rights, email us at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>

      <h2>Requesting deletion of your data</h2>
      <p>You can ask us to delete the personal data associated with your enquiry at any time. Deletion requests are handled by email: send a request to <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>, or use the button below, which opens a pre-filled email. We will verify the request and action it within a reasonable period, except where we are required to retain certain records by law.</p>
      <p><a href={delMail} class="btn btn-primary">Request data deletion by email</a></p>

      <h2>Data security</h2>
      <p>We take reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect your information against loss, misuse and unauthorised access. No method of transmission over the internet is completely secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

      <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
      <p>Our website and services are intended for businesses, institutions and adults. We do not knowingly collect personal data from children.</p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The "last updated" date above shows when it was last revised. Material changes will be reflected on this page.</p>

      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p>For any privacy questions or requests, contact us at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or call <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>. Our office: {site.address}.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>
  .prose { max-width: 72ch; }
  .prose h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin: 2rem 0 0.6rem; }
  .prose p { color: var(--text-soft); margin-bottom: 1rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .prose ul { margin: 0 0 1rem 1.1rem; color: var(--text-soft); display: grid; gap: 0.5rem; }
  .prose li { line-height: 1.6; }
  .prose :global(strong) { color: var(--text); }
  .prose .muted { color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .prose a { color: var(--grass-600); font-weight: 600; }
  :root[data-theme='dark'] .prose a { color: var(--grass-300); }
  .prose .btn { color: var(--forest-900); display: inline-flex; margin-top: 0.3rem; }
  :root[data-theme='dark'] .prose .btn { color: var(--forest-900); }
</style>
